      <graphic xml:id="m-dd7056af-1c7e-46c9-aa84-6f67379dac0a" target="0122_original_image.tiff" /><zone xml:id="m-e812c6fa-84f1-4c04-8041-f9bb6d41fc14" ulx="98" uly="90" lrx="143" lry="126" /><zone xml:id="m-e51b779b-7273-4bb3-8c6b-887a8d464432" ulx="409" uly="94" lrx="639" lry="132" /><zone xml:id="m-371b49a0-e93a-4bdb-a390-16129f524f63" ulx="93" uly="142" lrx="948" lry="177" /><zone xml:id="m-4133b52d-515b-4e9b-b04a-d4256a4a428b" ulx="91" uly="170" lrx="947" lry="204" /><zone xml:id="m-aa9c237c-eca0-4a4e-be3c-9714f22a3fec" ulx="91" uly="197" lrx="947" lry="230" /><zone xml:id="m-dc6c271e-93c2-43fb-9a46-e747b81f7de2" ulx="93" uly="225" lrx="946" lry="258" /><zone xml:id="m-2a0b1762-87b7-4781-93b2-8d8a4483b69a" ulx="94" uly="251" lrx="946" lry="286" /><zone xml:id="m-fbfefad8-f401-48b2-a142-76149ce65988" ulx="91" uly="278" lrx="515" lry="311" /><zone xml:id="m-6b742235-2546-4bf2-b095-cec30b276982" ulx="522" uly="279" lrx="946" lry="315" /><zone xml:id="m-081c74ef-1ba0-4a22-b284-82f36a4f859b" ulx="92" uly="312" lrx="947" lry="339" /><zone xml:id="m-eb395229-acbe-4bc5-9b6e-9fe9235da572" ulx="90" uly="333" lrx="947" lry="364" /><zone xml:id="m-4cfef1e7-2c65-4cc6-b7bc-f814144d1e2c" ulx="92" uly="357" lrx="945" lry="396" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-4ebe8d2a-e91e-4ec4-be4e-94b7d2dc4480" n="0122" facs="#m-3febfeb5-1c59-4e25-bcdc-4a47d5d44548" /><div xml:id="m-e542aa6c-1731-4b6a-b698-d6f6a20d38fb">
            <lg xml:id="m-0106771b-1fab-45b1-980e-133bf1063937">
              <l xml:id="m-157629c7-6509-489c-860c-62cce8371778" facs="#m-e812c6fa-84f1-4c04-8041-f9bb6d41fc14" label="ambiguous">101</l><l xml:id="m-0cb03216-2f3a-4f55-a0d3-8044b632b3f1" facs="#m-e51b779b-7273-4bb3-8c6b-887a8d464432" label="ambiguous">Proper Prefaces.</l><l xml:id="m-80f67eca-11f2-405d-be43-21b5ca9b9436" facs="#m-371b49a0-e93a-4bdb-a390-16129f524f63" label="lyrics-like">mérita, corónas dona tua; qui nobis Christum Dóminum nostrum. Per</l><l xml:id="m-046f0c0c-09d5-4866-98d0-8fecb31756c3" facs="#m-4133b52d-515b-4e9b-b04a-d4256a4a428b" label="lyrics-like">in eórum praebes et conversatióne quem Majestátem tuam laudant</l><l xml:id="m-f8e348cd-c2bb-4952-9afe-c2873cd6a9b5" facs="#m-aa9c237c-eca0-4a4e-be3c-9714f22a3fec" label="lyrics-like">exémplum, et communióne consór-l Angeli, adórant Dominatiónes, tre¬</l><l xml:id="m-61872d15-f512-4ff5-8c95-0f1a3dcf1ab8" facs="#m-dc6c271e-93c2-43fb-9a46-e747b81f7de2" label="lyrics-like">tium, et intercessióne subsídium : ut ! munt Potestátes, Caeli, caelorúm¬</l><l xml:id="m-d09118fd-44d0-43ba-8e95-0a831eba4dcf" facs="#m-2a0b1762-87b7-4781-93b2-8d8a4483b69a" label="lyrics-like">tantam habéntes impósitam nubem! que Virtútes, ac beáta Séraphim,</l><l xml:id="m-24673fc7-2b6a-433d-9534-9785f18c0385" facs="#m-fbfefad8-f401-48b2-a142-76149ce65988" label="lyrics-like">téstium, per patiéntam currámus</l><l xml:id="m-afd64ad0-44fa-403b-a873-76ccc279f6ba" facs="#m-6b742235-2546-4bf2-b095-cec30b276982" label="lyrics-like">sócia exsultatióne concélebrant.</l><l xml:id="m-ecf48c11-60be-4469-9812-91fb7f62c31a" facs="#m-081c74ef-1ba0-4a22-b284-82f36a4f859b" label="lyrics-like">ad propósitum nobis certámen, et! Cum quibus et nostras voces, ut</l><l xml:id="m-b111aaf4-a0aa-4059-b043-10d755d22c87" facs="#m-eb395229-acbe-4bc5-9b6e-9fe9235da572" label="lyrics-like">cum eis percipiámus immarcesci-ladmitti júbeas deprecámur, súpplici</l><l xml:id="m-258d2530-3810-48b5-bac5-1e495b4dce9c" facs="#m-4cfef1e7-2c65-4cc6-b7bc-f814144d1e2c" label="lyrics-like">bilem glóriae corónam; per Jesum l confessiõne dicéntes : Sanctus, etc.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>